# audio_scale_star, checked headless (`zig build audio-scale-star-check`): for each window of the run, in
# seconds, the pitch classes that must sound - every other must be silent - and the loudness, as RMS, the left
# channel. A Shepard note at velocity 0.5, centred, is 0.3755 x 0.5 x 0.7071 = 0.1328; three of them, whose partials
# all differ, 0.1328 x sqrt 3 = 0.2300. Each window starts 0.1 s into a hold and ends 0.05 s before its release.
#
# start  end    notes      rms
0.20   0.45   C          0.1328
1.20   1.45   D          0.1328
2.20   2.45   E          0.1328
3.20   3.45   F          0.1328
4.20   4.45   G          0.1328
5.20   5.45   A          0.1328
6.20   6.45   B          0.1328
7.20   7.45   C E G      0.2300
8.20   8.45   D F A      0.2300
9.20   9.45   E G B      0.2300
10.20   10.45   F A C      0.2300
11.20   11.45   G B D      0.2300
12.20   12.45   A C E      0.2300
13.20   13.45   B D F      0.2300
